<p>BORROWER RSL COMMUNICATIONS</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 12.25 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE N.A.</p>
